 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Keys and roles
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are `apiKeys: [{ key, name, role }]`
+in the data. A missing or unknown key is 401 `unauthorized`; a known key
+without permission is 403 `forbidden`.
+
+- `viewer`: GET requests.
+- `cook`: also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+  `POST /temperatures` and `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: everything, including `GET /audit`.
+
+## Audit
+
+Every request with a valid key that is not a GET adds `{ at, key, method,
+path, status }` to `audit` (also when it was refused or failed).
+`GET /audit` lists the entries newest first.
